          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rundi pier ario wi abije mi ng’eca mwa, i thekri mi rundine, i ceng’ mir apaje mi dwi, i rundi apar wi ang’wende yo ng’ei goyo adhura, i ceng’ maeno nino, cing Yehova ni i wia, man etera kuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 21:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ginmawokiwang’ pa Mungu etera i ng’om Israel, man eketha piny wi got ma wiu dit, ka ma giratada mir adhura ni i wie yor ariwa ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etera kuca; man, nen, dhanu nuti, ma nenne calu nen mi mola, ku thol mi pamba i cinge, ku bol mi poropiny; man ecungo i dhugang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanune wacu ira kumae, Wod dhanu, nen ku weng’i, man iwinj ku ithi, man iketh cwinyi kum gin ceke m’abinyutho iri; kum jukeli kuni kara anyuthgi iri: yer gin ceke m’ineno ni ot mir Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
